sentences.l:
and they, having received it, standing apart, stretch it
in a circle, and at once the moisture goes, and the fat sinks in
with many pulling, and it is stretched, all of it, right through;

Truly Automedon, Diores’ sturdy son,
many times with a swift whip kept lashing at them, striking them,
and many times spoke to them with gentle words, and many times with threats;

and tears for them, hot, from their eyelids to the ground
flowed, as they wept,
out of longing for the charioteer;

And into you two, in the knees, I will cast might, and in the heart,
so that you two may also save Automedon out of the war
to the hollow ships;
